1
00:00:26,000 --> 00:00:30,800
I left the phone booth in the rain

2
00:00:31,960 --> 00:00:37,060
Cold metal coins and bitter pain

3
00:00:38,170 --> 00:00:43,469
My father's shadow in my ear

4
00:00:44,649 --> 00:00:49,950
The heavy steps of guilt and fear

5
00:00:50,780 --> 00:00:56,079
A gravel path behind the gate

6
00:00:56,920 --> 00:01:02,219
A yellow light against my fate

7
00:01:02,780 --> 00:01:08,579
She opens up a wooden door

8
00:01:09,269 --> 00:01:13,719
I never felt this safe before

9
00:01:18,189 --> 00:01:23,150
Warm coffee in a floral cup

10
00:01:24,359 --> 00:01:28,959
Her mother sits across from me

11
00:01:30,620 --> 00:01:35,799
No angry voice, no iron rule

12
00:01:36,859 --> 00:01:42,000
With eyes that see what I could be

13
00:01:42,810 --> 00:01:47,549
Just cinnamon and quiet grace

14
00:01:48,989 --> 00:01:53,719
She asks about the notes I play

15
00:01:55,040 --> 00:02:00,219
Inside this unfamiliar place

16
00:02:01,390 --> 00:02:05,799
I watch my heavy guards decay

17
00:02:07,590 --> 00:02:12,599
Ginger leans against my side

18
00:02:13,729 --> 00:02:18,560
With nowhere left for fear to hide

19
00:02:19,919 --> 00:02:24,949
She pours the warmth into my soul

20
00:02:26,039 --> 00:02:38,590
For once I feel completely whole

21
00:02:56,780 --> 00:03:02,080
The kitchen clock is ticking fast

22
00:03:02,770 --> 00:03:08,069
I know this shelter cannot last

23
00:03:09,009 --> 00:03:14,810
Her mother walks me to the hall

24
00:03:15,229 --> 00:03:20,729
My coat hanging against the wall

25
00:03:21,469 --> 00:03:26,969
She wraps her arms around my chest

26
00:03:27,680 --> 00:03:33,180
And puts my trembling doubts to rest

27
00:03:33,900 --> 00:03:39,400
A gentle kiss upon my cheek

28
00:03:39,919 --> 00:03:45,289
The boy inside too stunned to speak

29
00:03:46,009 --> 00:03:52,159
A mother's kiss, so pure and kind

30
00:03:52,550 --> 00:03:57,150
Leaves the sorrow far behind

31
00:03:58,400 --> 00:04:04,319
A memory of grace to hold

32
00:04:04,360 --> 00:04:08,900
Before I walk into the cold